{"title": "Pack Tactics", "pageid": 4030, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Pack_Tactics", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pack_Tactics.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Pack_Tactics.webp/300px-Pack_Tactics.webp, /w/images/0/03/Pack_Tactics.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Pack_Tactics.webp/300px-Pack_Tactics.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Pack_Tactics.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Pack Tactics</b> is a passive feature that grants Advantage to attacks when an ally is close to the target.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When an ally is within 3 m (10 ft) of your target and is not <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a>, your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against the target have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodfang\" title=\"Bloodfang\">Bloodfang</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bugthimble\" title=\"Bugthimble\">Bugthimble</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/D%27hak\" title=\"D'hak\">D'hak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dire_Wolf\" title=\"Dire Wolf\">Dire Wolf</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dire_Wolf_(wild_shape)\" title=\"Dire Wolf (wild shape)\">Dire Wolf (wild shape)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Rat\" title=\"Giant Rat\">Giant Rat</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gordis\" title=\"Gordis\">Gordis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hyena\" title=\"Hyena\">Hyena</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hyena_(Shadow-Cursed_Lands)\" title=\"Hyena (Shadow-Cursed Lands)\">Hyena (Shadow-Cursed Lands)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Indra\" title=\"Indra\">Indra</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Isbeth\" title=\"Isbeth\">Isbeth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Istor\" title=\"Istor\">Istor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold_Inventor\" title=\"Kobold Inventor\">Kobold Inventor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold_Looter\" title=\"Kobold Looter\">Kobold Looter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold_Scout\" title=\"Kobold Scout\">Kobold Scout</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold_Thief\" title=\"Kobold Thief\">Kobold Thief</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Koll_(kobold)\" title=\"Koll (kobold)\">Koll (kobold)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lupus_Major\" title=\"Lupus Major\">Lupus Major</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lupus_Optumus\" title=\"Lupus Optumus\">Lupus Optumus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Gnoll\" title=\"Newborn Gnoll\">Newborn Gnoll</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Popper\" title=\"Popper\">Popper</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rocky\" title=\"Rocky\">Rocky</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\">Scratch</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Raven\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Raven\">Shadow-Cursed Raven</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Wolf\" title=\"Sharran Wolf\">Sharran Wolf</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Wolf_(Viconia)\" title=\"Sharran Wolf (Viconia)\">Sharran Wolf (Viconia)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">Silver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Snicker\" title=\"Snicker\">Snicker</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Squire\" title=\"Squire\">Squire</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ur%27uth\" title=\"Ur'uth\">Ur'uth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vulk\" title=\"Vulk\">Vulk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Whitemist\" title=\"Whitemist\">Whitemist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zina\" title=\"Zina\">Zina</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Allies within 3 m (10 ft) have <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on attack rolls against enemies adjacent to you.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195313\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1032/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6477/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3254/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2182/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 752909/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.857      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   44.857      1 -total\n 33.17%   14.878      1 Template:SmCond\n 16.37%    7.343      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 14.24%    6.386      3 Template:Icon_text\n 13.85%    6.214      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.36%    5.544      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.42%    4.676      6 Template:Trim\n  9.95%    4.464      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n  8.67%    3.888      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4030-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195313 and revision id 315493. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}